{"html_text": {"ja229:0.1": "<article id='ja229'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja229:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja229:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja229:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja229:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja229:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja229:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja229:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja229:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja229:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja229:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja229:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja229:3.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja229:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja229:0.2": "Dukanipāta ", "ja229:0.3": "Kāsāvavagga ", "ja229:0.4": "9. Palāyitajātaka ", "ja229:1.1": "“Gajaggameghehi hayaggamālibhi, ", "ja229:1.2": "Rathūmijātehi sarābhivassebhi; ", "ja229:1.3": "Tharuggahāvaṭṭadaḷhappahāribhi, ", "ja229:1.4": "Parivāritā takkasilā samantato. ", "ja229:2.1": "Abhidhāvatha cūpadhāvatha ca, ", "ja229:2.2": "Vividhā vināditā vadantibhi; ", "ja229:2.3": "Vattatajja tumulo ghoso yathā, ", "ja229:2.4": "Vijjulatā jaladharassa gajjato”ti. ", "ja229:3.1": "Palāyitajātakaṁ navamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja229:0.1": "", "ja229:0.2": "", "ja229:0.3": "", "ja229:0.4": "", "ja229:1.1": "", "ja229:1.2": "sarābhivassebhi → sarābhivassabhi (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); sarābhivassehi (pts-vp-pli1); sarābhivassibhi (?) ", "ja229:1.3": "Tharuggahāvaṭṭadaḷhappahāribhi → dhanuggahāvaṭṭa … (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja229:1.4": "", "ja229:2.1": "abhidhāvatha … gajjato”ti → abhidhāvathā ca patathā ca, vividhavinaditā ca dantibhi. vattatajja tumulo ghoso, yathā vijjutā jaladharassa gajjatoti. (si, pts1ed, mr) | Abhidhāvatha cūpadhāvatha ca → abhidhāvathā cuppatathā ca (sya1ed, sya2ed); abhidhāvathā ca patathā ca (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja229:2.2": "Vividhā vināditā → vividhavinaditā (sya1ed, sya2ed); vināditattha (mr) ", "ja229:2.3": "", "ja229:2.4": "", "ja229:3.1": "Palāyitajātakaṁ → palāsijātakaṁ (bj); palāyijātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja229:0.1": "", "ja229:0.2": "", "ja229:0.3": "", "ja229:0.4": "", "ja229:1.1": "ms22J_594, msdiv157, pts-vp-pli2.217", "ja229:1.2": "", "ja229:1.3": "", "ja229:1.4": "", "ja229:2.1": "csp1ed22.63, csp2ed22.63, ms22J_595, msdiv158", "ja229:2.2": "", "ja229:2.3": "", "ja229:2.4": "", "ja229:3.1": "ms22J_596"}, "keys_order": ["ja229:0.1", "ja229:0.2", "ja229:0.3", "ja229:0.4", "ja229:1.1", "ja229:1.2", "ja229:1.3", "ja229:1.4", "ja229:2.1", "ja229:2.2", "ja229:2.3", "ja229:2.4", "ja229:3.1"]}